                <p class="mb-1">• Set <code>FIZZY_ENDPOINT_URL</code> environment variable (all projects)</p>
                <p class="mb-1">• Set <code>FIZZY_ENDPOINT_URL_<%= @project.slug.upcase %></code> for this project only</p>
